<div style="text-align: center;">
<blockquote>
<p><em>So now they both dead.</em><br />
<em>And you slash your own throat.</em><br />
<em>So now it's double homicide and suicide—with no note!</em><br />
<em>I shoulda known better, when you started to act weird&#8230;</em><br />
<em>We coulda— hey, where you going? Get back here!</em><br />
<em>&#8212; Eminem, <a href="https://youtu.be/-SeVN2u5Axc">Kim</a></em></p>
</blockquote>
</div>
<p>This is my gift to the lovely <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gabriel-mcqueen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4558836); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4558836&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609331903" alt="Gabriel McQueen" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4558836)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gabriel-mcqueen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4558836); return false;">Gabriel McQueen</a></span>, whos request was:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>I'd love a tale, article, or poem about a location made strange, lonely, or haunted. Something has happened here, it may be unclear just what, before the time that the story picks up, that has changed a once innocuous place into something…else.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I hope you enjoy! This article is heavily inspired by both the quote above and <a href="https://youtu.be/6uFWshoWTLU">Water Fountain</a>, as well as another Eminem song that's referenced (little easter egg, teehee). You should definitely listen to the two linked here though! (<strong>NSFW, CONTENT WARNING</strong>)</p>
<p>Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dysadron" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4384469); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4384469&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609331903" alt="Dysadron" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4384469)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dysadron" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4384469); return false;">Dysadron</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5903100); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5903100&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609331903" alt="Pedagon" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5903100)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5903100); return false;">Pedagon</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3487700); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3487700&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609331903" alt="Uncle Nicolini" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3487700)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3487700); return false;">Uncle Nicolini</a></span> for their critique and help! Thank you <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1581620); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1581620&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609331903" alt="DarkStuff" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1581620)" /></a><a href="h