<p>Hey, recipient of the story here! I wanna say thanks, of course, for putting the time and effort into making this gift for me. I very much appreciated the content warning, as I didn't really expect such a violent story resulting from my prompt, but, having been warned, I was able to put myself into a mindset where I wasn't unpleasantly surprised by it. I'm intrigued by the underlying mystery here, and I think tales could spin off from this piece about the location, the McQueen family, and how the magic of the place and the actions of its inhabitants feed off of each other. That would be one way to side-step the violent mentally ill person stereotype as well, if it's hinted that Gabriel's violent tendencies are seeded by something anomalous in this place of his ancestry, something that influenced his father's connection to magic as well.</p>
<p>While I would be interested in seeing more stories branch off from this, I do have one request that I think I'm entitled to make: <em>if</em> Gabriel McQueen becomes a recurring character on the site, even just in one more piece, I would prefer if his first name were changed to something else. It was fun to read a story with &quot;my&quot; name in it, even given to a character whose actions I find abhorrent, and as long as it's clearly in the context of &quot;this was a gift for this person,&quot; I'm fine with keeping it! <em>But</em> my username becoming a recurring character out of my control would be almost weirder to me than reading my actual legal name in an SCP. Hope you understand!</p>

